{"term": "rutting", "lang": "en", "script": "latin", "romanization": null, "category": "desire_arousal_descriptors", "subcategory": "animal_sexual_drive", "concept": "animal_lust", "is_novel_concept": false, "register": "slang_crude", "crude": 65, "technical": 12, "recognition_pct_current": 62, "recognition_pct_peak": 62, "peak_year": null, "regional": null, "definition": "Driven by intense, uncontrolled animal-like sexual urges; behaving like a rutting beast in heat (applied crudely to humans).", "english_term": "rutting", "english_translation_quality": "direct", "notes": "Primarily a zoological term for the mating season of deer and ungulates; applying it to humans is a deliberate dehumanizing metaphor implying uncontrolled animal lust; 'rutting beast' is the common phrase form."}
